// - vero.fi (nettovarallisuus, page updated 1.1.2026): confirmed losses first, then the
//   automatic 5 % yrittäjävähennys, then the split. Capital-income part = 20 % calculated
//   return on (net assets at the end of the PREVIOUS tax year + 30 % of wages paid during
//   the 12 months before the end of the tax year); first year = end of that year; 10 % or
//   "all earned income" on request. Capital-income tax 30 %, 34 % above 30 000 €.
// - vero.fi (VAT registration, updated 19.1.2026): no registration needed only if turnover
//   is <= 20 000 € in BOTH the current and the preceding calendar year; if exceeded during
//   the year, registration from the date the threshold is exceeded.
// - vero.fi (YEL-maksut, updated 29.5.2026): deductible once — business, own or spouse's return.
